  "warmupMinutes": 30,
  "notes": [
    "Over HP-IB the app does the zero (Z, then readings until the auto-zero status clears; Example 2, p. 3-18), selects each range (1-5, or 9 for autorange), the mode (A watts, D dBm, C to store the dB REF, B dB REL) and the cal factor (+ off, - the front-panel switch), and takes readings with settling (T) (Table 3-3, p. 3-17; replies per Table 3-4).",
    "CAL ADJ and the CAL FACTOR switch have no bus control (para 3-15): the app asks for them and shows the live reading while CAL ADJ is set.",
    "Common setup: POWER REF off; the 11683A in STANDBY for 60 s before zeroing."
  ],
