        "After 60 s in STANDBY, hold SENSOR ZERO until the readout is stable (0.00 ±0.02, ZERO lamp lit), then release it.",
        "For each row: set the 11683A RANGE, switch FUNCTION to CALIBRATE and check the 436A autoranges to it, set RANGE HOLD on, switch FUNCTION to STANDBY, read, then RANGE HOLD off."
